        "id": 5160,
        "name": "PsiNorm",
        "username": "PsiNorm",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/e95f7d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-31T16:13:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have a copy of the game on the way, and can’t wait to play it. I’m wondering if there are any rules/plans for PvP? I could see a game like this with one on one battles, team against team, even big melee brawls. There could be PvP environments.</p>\n<p>I’m attracted to the idea that the game can be played the way that suits the group. Like Co-op? Got it. Like conflict? Hopefully getting it.</p>\n<p>I don’t know if buying a game because of the many ways I can see the game being played, rather than the single way the game ships is smart, but I’m always thinking of expansion possibilities, and I may be wrong thinking that the inclusion of such things is obvious.</p>\n<p>Looking forward to seeing where this game goes,<br>\nPsiNorm</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:44.327Z",
