        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-08T17:22:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The core of the game is designed to be cooperative, so making it PvP is much much more difficult than you might think.  Since there are already a ton of PvP games available, it is unlikely that we will make a PvP version of SotM.  However, we do have tons of expansions in mind that will expand both the story of the game as well as the rules and replay-ability.</p>",
