        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-26T15:06:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The little thought I have put into pvp is that it will at least require two heroes on eachside, that will help a little bit with some heroes. The only way to know for sure if pvp works is to try it out and come up with rules yourself to figure it out.</p>\n<p>Humorously I have did a pvp match with villians, Baron Blade Vs. Citizen Dawn. We played two matches and Baron Blade won both times, due to the 15 card limit rules. So… playing villians don’t really work out.</p>",
